Platform Operator Subsystem

Discussed functional requirements:
Tenant Management: FR-PO-1.1 Automated Tenant Onboarding, FR-PO-1.2 Customisation, FR-PO-1.3 Tenant Lifecycle Controls. 
These allow for: new environments to be created for universities,
customisation of branding & appearance and management of tenants including suspension, deletion and archiving.

Operator Management: FR-PO-2.1 Operator Access Control, FR-PO-2.2 Immutable Audit Logging.
These allow for: operator permissions to be controlled depending on role access and platform activities to be recorded.

Subscriptions: FR-PO-3.1 Multi-Tier Software-as-a-Service Licensing.
This allows for subscription tiers.

Usage Based Metering & Billing: FR-PO-3.2 Resource Usage Metering, FR-PO-3.3 Automated B2B Invoicing.
These allow for: the measurement of tenants resource usage and the automation of invoices.

Global & Cross-University Services: FR-PO-4.1 Centralised AI/ML Model Management, FR-PO-4.2 Cross-Tenant Benchmarking,
FR-PO-4.3 Continuous Active Machine Learning Pipeline, FR-PO-4.4 Tenant-Level System Broadcasts.
These allow for: the management of shared AI and machine learning models, comparisons of universities using anonymous data,
improvement of AI models using relevant data and errors and system announcements to be received by relevant tenants.

